00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:33.340
Like, I think maybe you did something wrong the first time.

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:35.440
Hmm. Sounds like you're projecting, Sean.

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:43.360
Yeah. Well, maybe this is a blameless game, but I'll tell you who would like to place some

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:46.180
blame on people, and that would be Marion, because she was shot dead.

