That's true. She's not like coming back in like a triumphant scene at the end or whatever.

00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:54.740
The game starts with being like, all hope is lost.

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:56.400
Like, your girlfriend's dead.

00:01:56.400 --> 00:02:02.300
Yeah, I mean, is this like the darkest we've gone in like the opening plot of any game

