Is the 1990X thing like, so they're like, oh, so now it's timeless, because we'll never

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:23.920
surpass 1990.

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:27.140
I think that, yeah, for the next 10 years, it's timeless.

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:33.640
That's a good point, though, Joe, because we are coming on like all the millennium talk,

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:37.040
so why would they do 19XX?

