And then, uh, if Billy died, it wouldn't, you know, you start over as Jimmy as player

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:03.080
two. You couldn't, uh, uh, sorry.

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:04.120
No, no, no. That's not true either.

